(8/17 /2026) Tj
T*
(PROTOCOL AUTHORIZATION) Tj
T*
(The Gladstone Fire Department has developed the following set of medical protocols.) Tj
T*
(These protocols have been reviewed and approved for use by Dr. Jared White, who) Tj
T*
(serves as Medical Director.) Tj
T*
(Medical Directors Statement of Approval and Compliance) Tj
T*
(It is to our knowledge, all Gladstone Fire Department personnel meet or exceed the) Tj
T*
(requirements as prescribed by the Missouri Bureau of EMS, and are licensed in good) Tj
T*
(standing as required through policy, protocol, continuing education and skills) Tj
T*
(competency evaluation.) Tj
T*
(I have reviewed and approve the medical protocols for the Gladstone Fire Department.) Tj
T*
(Approval Date: 08/17 /2026) Tj
T*
(Revision Date: 08/17 /2026) Tj
T*
(On file) Tj
