BT
/F1 9 Tf
11 TL
40 760 Td
(Gladstone Fire Department EMS Protocols - 2026 Revision V3) Tj
T*
(Text-rendered internal source copy | Original PDF physical page 8 of 142) Tj
T*
T*
(05/23/2025) Tj
T*
(MEDICAL CONTROL) Tj
T*
(North Kansas City Hospital \(NKCH\) shall serve as the primary medical control hospital) Tj
T*
(for the Gladstone Fire Department. All references within medical protocols unless) Tj
T*
(otherwise stated, shall be directed toward North Kansas City Hospital.) Tj
T*
(Liberty Hospital \(LH\) shall serve as a secondary medical control hospital for the City of) Tj
T*
(Gladstone, emergency medical service. If unable to contact North Kansas City Hospital,) Tj
T*
(requests for orders shall be obtained from Liberty Hospital.) Tj
T*
(If the patient requests transport to an alternate hospital, medical control at the receiving) Tj
T*
(hospital should be contacted for orders. If unable to obtain orders from the receiving) Tj
T*
(facility, contact North Kansas City Hospital medical control for orders.) Tj
T*
(For Pediatric patients \(under the age of 18\), Children's Mercy Hospital \(CMH\) shall serve) Tj
T*
(as the primary medical control hospital.) Tj
T*
ET
endstream
endobj
