T*
(Text-rendered internal source copy | Original PDF physical page 13 of 142) Tj
T*
T*
(05/23/2025) Tj
T*
(PATIENT DESTINATION CRITERIA CONT:) Tj
T*
(B. If NKCH, Liberty, and Truman are all on diversion, consider KU or St. Luke's) Tj
T*
(on the Plaza for patients meeting criteria.) Tj
T*
(C. Trauma codes should be taken to the nearest Level I/II trauma center whether) Tj
T*
(the trauma center is on diversion status or not.) Tj
T*
(D. Patients who meet the trauma routing criteria and are less than 18 years of) Tj
T*
(age shall be transported to a pediatric trauma center \(Children's Mercy) Tj
T*
(Hospital\).) Tj
T*
(HOSPITAL TCD \(Time Critical Diagnosis\) DESIGNATION) Tj
T*
(LEVEL 1 TRAUMA CENTERS:) Tj
T*
(*KU Medical Center \(PRIMARY Burn Center and Hyperbaric Chamber\)) Tj
T*
(*St. Luke's - Plaza) Tj
T*
(*Research Medical Center \(Secondary Burn Center\)) Tj
T*
(*Truman Medical Center) Tj
T*
(LEVEL 2 TRAUMA CENTERS:) Tj
T*
(*North Kansas City Hospital \(Primary\)) Tj
T*
(*Liberty Hospital \(Secondary\)) Tj
T*
(ACUTE STEMI) Tj
T*
(*North Kansas City Hospital \(Primary\)) Tj
T*
(*St. Luke's - Plaza \(Secondary\)) Tj
T*
(*KU Medical Center \(Secondary\)) Tj
T*
(*Liberty Hospital \() Tj
T*
(*St. Luke's Northland) Tj
T*
(ACUTE CVA) Tj
T*
(*St. Luke's - Plaza \(Primary\)) Tj
T*
(*KU Medical Center \(Secondary\)) Tj
T*
(*Research Medical Center \(Secondary\)) Tj
T*
(**St. Lukes is the definitive stroke treatment center, however if a pt refuses to go there) Tj
T*
(then) Tj
T*
(they may be taken to a stroke center of their choice. If they wish to go to NKCH educate) Tj
T*
(them that there may be the possibility they could be transferred out of if they have certain) Tj
T*
(problems. **) Tj
T*
(Note: Patients meeting routing criteria SHALL NOT be taken to undesignated hospitals w/o) Tj
T*
(medical control \(physician\) approval and/or contact with the receiving physician.) Tj
T*
(Note: Patient preference and continuity of care should always be considered, for example) Tj
T*
(the patient has received all cardiac care at KU Medical Center, it would be beneficial for) Tj
T*
(the) Tj
T*
(patient to be transported to KU even though it is not the closest facility. When in doubt) Tj
T*
(contact medical control.) Tj
T*
ET
endstream
