T*
(Text-rendered internal source copy | Original PDF physical page 22 of 142) Tj
T*
T*
(05/25/2025) Tj
T*
(QUALITY IMPROVEMENT PROCEDURE) Tj
T*
(The Quality Assurance/ Quality Improvement \(QA/QI\) Program is a systematic evaluation to) Tj
T*
(ensure excellence in delivery of patient care and operations of the Gladstone EMS system.) Tj
T*
(Quality Assurance is a formal methodology designed to assess the quality of services) Tj
T*
(provided and includes formal review of care, problem identification, corrective actions to) Tj
T*
(remedy any deficiencies and evaluation of actions taken.) Tj
T*
(Quality Improvement is a continuous process that identifies problems in health care) Tj
T*
(delivery,) Tj
T*
(examines solutions to those problems, and regularly monitors the solutions for improvement.) Tj
T*
(Our program will focus on ways to improve pre-hospital care rather than administering) Tj
T*
(discipline and destructive criticism.) Tj
T*
(A. To continually provide suggestions for improvement in the quality of medical care) Tj
T*
(rendered.) Tj
T*
(B. To improve patient care by adjusting protocols, treatment decisions, and procedures) Tj
T*
(as needed.) Tj
T*
(C. To ensure proper medical documentation.) Tj
T*
(Procedure) Tj
T*
(A. The EMS Quality Assurance Manager, Medical Director or his designee shall review) Tj
T*
(the following categories of calls.) Tj
T*
(1. All cardiac arrests.) Tj
T*
(2. Any call marked life threatening.) Tj
T*
(3. All calls involving any new medication or procedure for the first six months of) Tj
T*
(use.) Tj
T*
(4. Any call that varies from protocol.) Tj
T*
(5. Any call that the attending paramedic or supervisor desires reviewed.) Tj
T*
(6. Any STEMI activations.) Tj
T*
(7. Any Stroke activations.) Tj
T*
(8. Any Trauma activation.) Tj
T*
(9. Any Hospital diversions.) Tj
T*
(10. Academic review) Tj
T*
(B. Patient Safety Work Product \(PSWP\) meeting criteria for inclusion as defined in the) Tj
T*
(Patient Safety Organization \(PSO\) Policy shall be promptly submitted to the Patient) Tj
T*
(Safety Evaluation System \(PSES\) for evaluation and reporting to the Missouri Center) Tj
T*
(for Patient Safety \(MOCPS\).) Tj
T*
(C. Upon the report return from the Medical Director, the attending Paramedic and) Tj
T*
(Supervisors will review, comment \(if needed\) and sign the QA Worksheet.) Tj
T*
ET
endstream
endobj
