T*
(PUBLIC SERVICE CALLS - DOCUMENTATION) Tj
T*
(Purpose) Tj
T*
(To provide for adequate and uniform documentation of calls for public service or assistance.) Tj
T*
(These include but are not limited to:) Tj
T*
(a. Lifting assistance.) Tj
T*
(b. Assistance to or from a vehicle.) Tj
T*
