T*
(05/23/2025) Tj
T*
(ALS ENGINE REFUSALS) Tj
T*
(To allow Paramedics responding on ALS equipped fire apparatus to cancel an ambulance) Tj
T*
(response and obtain a patient refusal.) Tj
T*
(Procedure) Tj
T*
(Gladstone ALS apparatus staffed by paramedic personnel may assess patient condition and) Tj
T*
(need for ambulance transport. If it is determined, based on the assessment of the patient, a) Tj
T*
(transport ambulance is not needed and/or the patient does not desire ambulance transport,) Tj
T*
(the responding ambulance may be cancelled and a patient refusal accepted. It is the) Tj
T*
(responsibility of the attending paramedic to explain all options for transport if medical) Tj
T*
(attention is deemed necessary.) Tj
T*
(Documentation) Tj
T*
(Listed below is the minimum criterion required for Gladstone Fire Department reports.) Tj
T*
(How the call was received from dispatch, pre-arrival information, units responding location) Tj
T*
(and mode of response:) Tj
T*
(1. Nature of the call on arrival.) Tj
T*
(2. How the patient was found, presenting signs, appearance and pertinent scene) Tj
T*
(factors.) Tj
T*
(3. The patient's chief complaint.) Tj
T*
(4. HPI & PPMH) Tj
T*
(5. Vital signs. This includes: blood pressure, pulse rate, respiratory rate, and) Tj
T*
(SpO2 and EtCO2 readings if applicable.) Tj
T*
(6. IV attempts, location, patency and who initiates.) Tj
T*
(7. Intubation attempts, ET tube location measured from the teeth in cm, and) Tj
T*
(confirmation methods.) Tj
T*
(8. Medication administration, name, dose, route and results.) Tj
T*
(9. Procedures performed, by whom and results.) Tj
T*
(10.The patient's overall response to treatment.) Tj
T*
(11.Attending Paramedic shall end the report with their full name, title and state) Tj
T*
(license number \(P#\).) Tj
T*
(All calls shall be documented in the first person, past tense and in chronological order,) Tj
T*
(from) Tj
T*
(the time of dispatch through return to service.) Tj
T*
(All reports shall be written utilizing proper grammar, spelling and only Department approved) Tj
T*
(abbreviations.) Tj
T*
ET
