(RESPIRATORY DISTRESS) Tj
T*
(Respiratory distress can be divided into processes involving the upper or lower airway.) Tj
T*
(Examples of) Tj
T*
(upper airway obstruction include: foreign body, epiglottitis, croup, and trauma. Diseases) Tj
T*
(that cause) Tj
T*
(lower airway obstruction include: asthma, COPD, pneumonia, CHF, and pneumothorax. If unable) Tj
T*
(to) Tj
T*
