(adequate ventilation, and transport rapidly.) Tj
T*
(Assessment:) Tj
T*
(1. Assess adequacy of airway and ventilation to include: vocalization, rate and depth,) Tj
T*
(breathe sounds,) Tj
T*
(cyanosis, and signs of respiratory distress.) Tj
