(intubated, consider Versed 2-4 mg SIVP up to a total dose of 10 mg. If unable to obtain IV) Tj
T*
(access, consider IN Versed 2 - 4 mg, max 10 mg. See intranasal procedure.) Tj
T*
(4. Duoneb 3 ml nebulized. Set O2 at 6-8 lpm. Consider if needed Albuterol 2.5 mg x 2, heart) Tj
T*
(rate) Tj
T*
(should not exceeds150 bpm. Xoponex may also be considered if other medications are) Tj
T*
(ineffective or contra-indicated \(Pediatric dosing of Xoponex, dilute with 3ml of NS\)) Tj
T*
(5. Consider Solu-Medrol 62.5 mg IV. Pediatric 2mg/kg USE WITH EXTREME CAUTION IN) Tj
T*
(DIABETIC PATIENTS AS MAY INCREASE INSULIN METABOLIC REQUIREMENTS) Tj
T*
(6. For severe cases consider Magnesium Sulfate 1g drip over 10 min, re evaluate recheck) Tj
T*
(vitals) Tj
T*
(and then give the second 1g dose over 10 min. Consider Epinephrine 1:1,000 concentration,) Tj
T*
(0.3) Tj
T*
(mg IM. Contact medical control for orders if age is over 40 AND pulse rate > 120, or HX of) Tj
T*
(CAD. Consider Terbutaline 0.25mg SQ.) Tj
T*
(7. Consider BiPap.) Tj
T*
(Note: Surgical airway may be) Tj
T*
(necessary in severe maxo-facial) Tj
