T*
(05/23/2025) Tj
T*
(ALBUTEROL \(PROVENTIL, VENTOLIN\)) Tj
T*
(CLASS OF DRUG) Tj
T*
(Sympathomimetic, Beta 2 selective adrenergic bronchodilator) Tj
T*
(INDICATIONS) Tj
T*
(1. Albuterol is used to treat reversible airway obstruction caused by:) Tj
T*
(a. Wheezing associated with asthma) Tj
T*
(b. COPD) Tj
T*
(CONTRAINDICATIONS) Tj
T*
(1. Hypersensitivity) Tj
T*
(DRUG INTERACTION) Tj
T*
(1. Beta adrenergic agents - potentiates the effects) Tj
T*
(2. MAO inhibitors - may lead to hypertensive crisis) Tj
T*
(3. Beta adrenergic blockers - decreases the effectiveness) Tj
T*
(ADMINISTRATION) Tj
T*
(Nebulizer) Tj
T*
(Adult: [2.5mg] in 3 ml of sterile NS given as inhalation) Tj
T*
(therapy over 5-15 minutes, may be repeated x 2.) Tj
T*
(Pediatric: [1.25-2.5 mg] in 3 ml of sterile NS given as inhalation) Tj
T*
(therapy over 5-15 minutes, may be repeated x 2.) Tj
T*
(SPECIAL NOTES) Tj
T*
(1. Most side effects are dosage related.) Tj
T*
ET
endstream
endobj
