(Tricyclic Antidepressant List, Common) Tj
T*
(The TCAs include the following agents which are predominantly serotonin and/or) Tj
T*
(norepinephrine reuptake inhibitors:) Tj
T*
(* Amitriptyline \(Tryptomer, Elavil\)) Tj
T*
(* Amitriptylinoxide \(Amioxid, Ambivalon, Equilibrin\)) Tj
T*
(* Butriptyline \(Evadyne\)) Tj
T*
(* Clomipramine \(Anafranil\)) Tj
T*
(* Demexiptiline \(Deparon, Tinoran\)) Tj
T*
