T*
(* Pipofezine \(Azafen/Azaphen\)) Tj
T*
(* Propizepine \(Depressin, Vagran\)) Tj
T*
(* Protriptyline \(Vivactil\)) Tj
T*
(* Quinupramine \(Kevopril, Kinupril, Adeprim, Quinuprine\)) Tj
T*
(As well as the following atypical compounds:) Tj
T*
(* Amineptine \(Survector, Maneon, Directim\) - Norepinephrine-dopamine reuptake) Tj
T*
(inhibitor) Tj
T*
(* Iprindole \(Prondol, Galatur, Tetran\) - 5-HT2 receptor antagonist) Tj
T*
(* Opipramol \(Insidon, Pramolan, Ensidon, Oprimol\) - receptor agonist) Tj
T*
(* Tianeptine \(Stablon, Coaxil, Tatinol\) - Selective serotonin reuptake enhancer) Tj
T*
(* Trimipramine \(Surmontil\) - 5-HT2 receptor antagonist) Tj
