T*
(05/23/2025) Tj
T*
(Calcium Channel Blockers) Tj
T*
(Calcium channel blockers are called CCBs for short. They are also called calcium) Tj
T*
(channel antagonists. CCBs are the most widely prescribed medicines in the United) Tj
T*
(States today. They can be used alone or in a combination pill with an ACE inhibitor) Tj
T*
(When are calcium channel blockers prescribed?) Tj
T*
(In addition to treating those with high blood pressure, calcium channel blockers are also) Tj
T*
(used for people who have heart disease. Because they allow the blood vessels that) Tj
T*
(supply the heart to open wider, more oxygen-rich blood can get to the heart. They are) Tj
T*
(also used to treat arrhythmia.) Tj
T*
(Blockers) Tj
T*
(The following table lists some common brand and generic names for calcium channel) Tj
T*
(blockers.) Tj
T*
(Brand Generic) Tj
T*
(Adalat CC Nifedipine) Tj
T*
(Calan SR verapamil HCl) Tj
T*
(Cardene nicardipine HCl) Tj
T*
(Cardene SR nicardipine HCl) Tj
T*
(Cardizem CD diltiazem HCl) Tj
T*
(Cardizem SR diltiazem HCl) Tj
T*
(Covera-HS verapamil HCl) Tj
T*
(Dilacor XR diltiazem HCl) Tj
T*
(DynaCirc Isradipine) Tj
T*
(DynaCirc CR Isradipine) Tj
T*
(Isoptin SR verapamil HCl) Tj
T*
(Nimotop Nimodipine) Tj
T*
(Norvasc amlodipine besylate) Tj
T*
(Plendil Felodipine) Tj
T*
(Procardia XL Nifedipine) Tj
T*
(Sular Nisoldipine) Tj
T*
(Tiamate diltiazem HCl) Tj
T*
(Tiazac diltiazem HCl) Tj
T*
(Vascor bepridil HCl) Tj
T*
(Verelan verapamil HCl) Tj
T*
(Verelan PM) Tj
T*
ET
